   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Possessives",
     "texto": [
      "The possessives **mój**, **moja** and **moje** agree with the thing owned, not with the owner.",
      "**twój**, **twoja** and **twoje** also change according to the gender of the noun. In Polish, the possessive does not work as one fixed form like English «my» or «your»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
